# nvfbc-relay policy replay fixture
# Avatar 59 fps base with frame generation x2 (118 fps displayed on a VRR panel), declared -src 60, b:flip present, -lock -lag 75 -dejit. One benchmark test, no fade at either end. keep-real collapses each pair to its real member, so the policy sees 59 effective frames into a 60 Hz sink and walks the same phase ramp as the FG-off pair.
# units: microseconds. first value absolute, rest are deltas.
description Avatar 59 fps base with frame generation x2 (118 fps displayed on a VRR panel), declared -src 60, b:flip present, -lock -lag 75 -dejit. One benchmark test, no fade at either end. keep-real collapses each pair to its real member, so the policy sees 59 effective frames into a 60 Hz sink and walks the same phase ramp as the FG-off pair.
